      "role": "user",
      "content": "it just feels like i'm stuck in this void. why is everyone so obsessed with making me stay in a world that feels completely broken? it's not about being \"safe\", it's about the fact that everything feels so much more right when i think about just being with him. it feels like the only way to actually find peace.",
